<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello,&nbsp;</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">To apply for temporary loan modification, please send the following:</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;"></p><ul style="font-family: arial;"><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif">August and September bank statements</font></li><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif">October month to date bank transaction history</font></li></ul><p style="font-family: arial;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please answer the following questions:</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;"></p><ul style="font-family: arial;"><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Why the need for modification?&nbsp;</font></li><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif">When will you be able to resume payment?&nbsp;</font></li><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif">When will you be able to catch up missed payment?</font></li></ul><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>*all missed payments will require a catchup plan to be setup within 1 month of payment resuming*&nbsp;</b></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><p style="font-family: arial;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Once received, I will submit to a credit manager with your request to temporarily modify payment.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please call me with any questions.</font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Title}</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">National Funding, Inc.,&nbsp;the parent and servicing&nbsp;company of&nbsp;</span></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Quick Bridge Funding, LLC</span></b></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;">9820 Towne Centre Drive</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">San Diego, CA 92121</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</span></div></div></div>]]></td>
